# 统一换行符：仓库里一律 LF（Linux 容器里 Dockerfile / shell 脚本带 CRLF 会直接报错），
# Windows 上的 PowerShell 脚本保留 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做任何换行符转换与 diff
*.parquet binary
*.pkl binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.npy binary
